  "releaseNotes": "New In This Release:\n      - Add Support for .NET 11\n      - Breaking Change: the InvalidHandleEventException constructor now throws ArgumentNullException for a null message or a null inner exception\n      - Assembly version is now 11.0.0.0: .NET Framework apps may need binding redirects, as with every major release\n      - Fix WeakEventManager skipping event handlers created with DynamicMethod when a .NET Standard assembly runs on .NET 8 or later",
